
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Ghana Smart Hub</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f3f7f5;
      color: #18352b;
    }
    header {
      background: #075e43;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; }
    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 15px;
      background: white;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #075e43;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    main {
      max-width: 750px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 16px 0;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #0000000d;
    }
    .card h2 { color: #075e43; }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #087f5b;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 17px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: none;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .note { color: #58665f; line-height: 1.6; }
    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      background: #18352b;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>Ghana Smart Hub 🇬🇭</h1>
    <p>Data bundles and examination checker shop</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#data">Buy Data</a>
    <a href="#wassce">WASSCE</a>
    <a href="#bece">BECE</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </nav>

  <main>
    <section class="card">
      <h2>Welcome!</h2>
      <p>Get your data bundles and examination checker products in one place.</p>
      <p class="note">Our online shop is being prepared. Real orders will be enabled after supplier and payment setup.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="data">
      <h2>📱 Data Bundles</h2>
      <p>MTN, Telecel and AT data bundles.</p>
      <p class="note">Bundle options and current prices will be added after supplier setup.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Ask about data</a>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="wassce">
      <h2>🎓 WASSCE Result Checker</h2>
      <p>Find legitimate WASSCE checker products.</p>
      <p class="note">PIN sales will be enabled after an authorized supply channel is confirmed.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://waecgh.org/result-checker/">Official checker page</a>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="bece">
      <h2>📚 BECE Result Checker</h2>
      <p>Find legitimate BECE checker products.</p>
      <p class="note">PIN sales will be enabled after an authorized supply channel is confirmed.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="https://waecgh.org/result-checker/">Official checker page</a>
    </section>

    <section class="card" id="contact">
      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Contact details will be added before the shop launches.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Ghana Smart Hub</p>
    <p>Ghana 🇬🇭</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
